# recv returns [Result.Ok v] on successful receive
# Phase 3: recv protocol redesign (T-811)
#
# Strategy: force send before recv by making result depend on sent.
# [= sent []] forces the send call (send returns []), then recv runs.
# The dict's ch: field is never serialized — only %.result is accessed.
# Multi-doc pipeline: doc 1 returns the computation dict; doc 2 matches.
[
  ch: [channel 10]
  sent: [send ch 42]
  result: [if [= sent []] [recv ch] [recv ch]]
]
---
[match %.result
  [Result.Ok v]: v
  [Closed]: -1]
=== out
Int(42)
